&LENNARD-JONES
  ATOMS CR YA
  EPSILON [kjmol] $CR_YA_epsilon
  SIGMA [nm]  $CR_YA_sigma
  RCUT  [angstrom]  $CUTOFF
&END LENNARD-JONES

&LENNARD-JONES
